          "type": "text",
          "text": "{\"id\":\"TAC-561\",\"title\":\"Integration request: Podium\",\"description\":\"Provider: Podium\\nTeam: HVAC Front Desk\\nTeam charter: Handle inbound HVAC service requests, follow up on stale quotes, and keep the schedule full.\\nBusiness context: We run an HVAC service business and want the front desk work automated.\\nOrigin: Team Builder setup\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Debug Context**\\n\\n* **User:** [rblalock@agentuity.com](<mailto:rblalock@agentuity.com>) (`guser_328aef44a1b6abd01e86fb11`)\\n* **Page URL:** [http://127.0.0.1:3500/teams/w/teambuild_16061f08bed0f3ba65525f05](<http://127.0.0.1:3500/teams/w/teambuild_16061f08bed0f3ba65525f05>)\",\"priority\":{\"value\":3,\"name\":\"Medium\"},\"estimate\":{\"value\":8,\"name\":\"XL\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/agentuity/issue/TAC-561/integration-request-podium\",\"gitBranchName\":\"tac-561-integration-request-podium\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-15T14:38:03.688Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-07T05:40:23.833Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-04T21:58:16.212Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":\"2026-08-07\",\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Progress\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"Feature\",\"App\",\"Customer\",\"Integration\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"d9a9fe92-bc6f-490c-8fcc-93c87ee12ab1\",\"title\":\"feat: add experimental Podium integration\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/agentuity/genesis-mono/pull/1013\"}],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"ca21725b-1da0-47f6-a428-c5af7ea240a7\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-15T14:38:03.688Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-07-28T12:43:24.068Z\"},{\"state\":{\"id\":\"0e53370a-3a01-4214-9108-ed65bf40e5d9\",\"name\":\"Todo\",\"type\":\"unstarted\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-28T12:43:24.068Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-07-28T20:23:55.351Z\"},{\"state\":{\"id\":\"ca21725b-1da0-47f6-a428-c5af7ea240a7\",\"