          "type": "text",
          "text": "{\"id\":\"TAC-899\",\"title\":\"Auth-side API-key connection secrets store\",\"description\":\"## Problem\\n\\nOAuth connections store secrets in `apps/auth` (`genesis_oauth_credential`). Shopmonkey and Printavo pasted API keys into Genesis web and encrypted them on `user_integration.credentials`, splitting secret ownership across different crypto/audit surfaces.\\n\\n## Decision\\n\\nAdd an intentional **sibling** credential store in `apps/auth` for non-OAuth connection secrets (`genesis_connection_secret`), same HMAC product boundary as the OAuth broker. Gateway/web remains the only caller; Hub never talks to auth for raw keys.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n* Auth schema + HMAC routes: put / reveal / status / revoke\\n* Migrate Shopmonkey + Printavo connect/resolve/disconnect to auth\\n* One-shot migration script for existing ciphertext rows\\n* Docs / `AGENTS.md` updates\\n\\n## PR\\n\\n[https://github.com/agentuity/genesis-mono/pull/984](<https://github.com/agentuity/genesis-mono/pull/984>)\\n\\n## Follow-ups after merge\\n\\n* Apply `apps/auth/sql/genesis_connection_secret.sql` on `service_admin`\\n* Run `migrate-api-key-credentials-to-auth.ts` where legacy rows exist\\n* Drop dual-read / legacy DB decrypt once migration is complete\",\"priority\":{\"value\":3,\"name\":\"Medium\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/agentuity/issue/TAC-899/auth-side-api-key-connection-secrets-store\",\"gitBranchName\":\"tac-899-auth-side-api-key-connection-secrets-store\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-03T16:24:08.092Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-03T16:24:08.092Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-03T16:24:08.184Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Review\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"Integration\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"24fe7165-5d10-421b-9946-e42e9534176b\",\"title\":\"feat(auth): API-key connection secrets store beside OAuth broker\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/agentuity/genesis-mono/pull/984\"}],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"20580cc2-8be2-4efa-82bb-de3069e47056\",\"name\":\"In Review\",\"type\":\"started\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-03T16:24:08.092Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\",\"createdById\":\"da28c5da-c96f-479f-b9d7-aa60800cd6af\",\"assignee\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\",\"assigneeId\":\"da28c5da-c96f-479f-b9d7-aa60800cd6af\",\"project\":\"Genesis\",\"projectId\":\"4e08de05-a9c6-4111-91f8-809f8683ec38\",\"team\":\"The Agent Company\",\"teamId\":\"4bb32a8d-f4b6-4d35-8efc-a544d30e081d\",\"relations\":{\"blocks\":[],\"blockedBy\":[],\"relatedTo\":[{\"id\":\"TAC-808\",\"title\":\"Integration: Shopmonkey\"}],\"duplicateOf\":null}}"
        }
