          "text": "{\"id\":\"TAC-779\",\"title\":\"Genesis API exits on Salesforce Pub/Sub / CDC stream failures\",\"description\":\"## Summary\\n\\nEnabling Collections sync (any integration) can kill the entire Genesis API process when Salesforce Pub/Sub CDC is enabled for the org, or when a Postgres logical-replication client disconnects without a listener. `concurrently` then tears down Vite as well.\\n\\nHit while validating QuickBooks Collections sync on [TAC-577](<https://linear.app/agentuity/issue/TAC-577/integration-quickbooks>) (local Huijiro org). Workaround: temporarily disable Salesforce `integration_sync_entity` rows, enable the other integration, then restore SF.\\n\\n## Repro (Salesforce path)\\n\\n1. Local Genesis with Salesforce sync entities **enabled** (Pub/Sub / `inboundTransport: poll_and_stream`).\\n2. Enable sync for another integration (e.g. QuickBooks → Customers) from Settings, or otherwise call `ensureCollectionSyncInfrastructure` / `bootstrapInboundStreams`.\\n3. API process exits; Vite dies with it. Logs around the enable show Salesforce Pub/Sub bootstrap / gRPC auth failure (`UNAUTHENTICATED`, `tenantid` metadata).\\n\\n## Why it spreads across integrations\\n\\n`enableIntegrationSyncEntity` always calls:\\n\\n```ts\\nawait ensureCollectionSyncInfrastructure({ label: \\\"sync-enable\\\" });\\n```\\n\\nThat runs `bootstrapInboundStreams()` → `reconcileAllInboundStreams()`, which starts stream consumers for **every** integration with enabled stream-capable entities — not only the entity being enabled.\\n\\nSalesforce `reconcileInboundStream` → `startSalesforcePubSubSupervisor()` → `salesforce-pubsub-api-client` connects with gRPC metadata:\\n\\n* `accesstoken`\\n* `instanceurl`\\n* `tenantid` = Salesforce organization id (from userinfo)\\n\\nAuth / tenant mismatches surface as gRPC `UNAUTHENTICATED` (tenantid). Even though supervisor/subscriber have try/catch and `onFatalError` eviction paths, failures still take down `dev:api` (unhandled stream / EventEmitter error class — same failure mode as below).\\n\\nRelevant code:\\n\\n* `apps/web/src/services/collection-sync/bootstrap.ts` (`bootstrapInboundStreams`)\\n* `apps/web/src/services/integration-sync/inbound-stream.ts`\\n* `apps/web/src/services/integration-sync/salesforce-pubsub/supervisor.ts`\\n* `apps/web/src/services/integration-sync/salesforce-pubsub/subscriber.ts`\\n* `apps/web/src/integrations/sync/salesforce/index.ts` (`reconcileInboundStream`)\\n\\n## Related crash (CDC / pg Client)\\n\\nOn 2026-07-23 the QB worktree API also died after webhook-inbox CDC logged a normal disconnect:\\n\\n```\\n[integration-sync.webhook-inbox] replication stream disconnected: Connection terminated unexpectedly\\n[integration-sync.webhook-inbox] replication stream ended (expected reconnect): ...\\nerror: Connection terminated unexpectedly  // pg Client emit('error') — process exit\\ndev:api exited with code 1\\n```\\n\\n`pgoutput-subscriber` handles `service.on(\\\"error\\\")`, but an underlying `pg.Client` still emitted `error` with no listener and Bun exited. Same product bug class: **durable stream disconnects must not be fatal to the API process**.\\n\\n## Expected\\n\\n* Salesforce Pub/Sub auth/stream errors isolate to that integration (log + pause/evict subscriber; surface entity health).\\n* Enabling QuickBooks (or any other sync) must not crash the process because Salesforce stream reconcile failed.\\n* CDC / replication disconnects reconnect or step down without process exit.\\n\\n## Suggested fix direction\\n\\n1. Catch and contain Salesforce Pub/Sub connect/subscribe/gRPC errors inside the supervisor; never rethrow out of bootstrap in a way that can become an unhandled rejection; attach listeners for any EventEmitter/`pg` clients the library uses.\\n2. On `UNAUTHENTICATED` / bad `tenantid`: mark Salesforce sync unhealthy, stop the subscriber, do not retry-storm; do not affect other integrations’ enable path.\\n3. Optionally: sync-enable should reconcile streams for the **enabled integration only**, not re-bootstrap every stream module (or make global bootstrap fully non-fatal).\\n4. Audit webhook-inbox / collection CDC for bare `pg.Client` instances missing `.on(\\\"error\\\")`.\\n\\n## Workaround\\n\\n```sql\\n-- temporarily disable SF sync entities, enable other integration, then restore\\nUPDATE integration_sync_entity SET enabled = false WHERE integration_id = 'salesforce';\\n```\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n* Discovered during <issue id=\\\"3b295d93-5e0d-4ab3-88fc-20e80d04aaee\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/agentuity/issue/TAC-577/integration-quickbooks\\\">TAC-577</issue> QuickBooks Collections validation (PR <pull-request id=\\\"69e599e1-c953-450d-89ae-90e4456552b5\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/agentuity/review/featintegrations-quickbooks-online-broker-connection-tac-577-a04aa3908d29\\\">agentuity/genesis-mono#729</pull-request>).\\n* Salesforce Pub/Sub feature: <issue id=\\\"4db4262f-fc41-460a-a4e5-ae2be7cae665\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/agentuity/issue/TAC-611/salesforce-sync-pubsub-cdc-bridge-for-near-real-time-inbound\\\">TAC-611</issue> (Done).\",\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/agentuity/issue/TAC-779/genesis-api-exits-on-salesforce-pubsub-cdc-stream-failures\",\"gitBranchName\":\"tac-779-genesis-api-exits-on-salesforce-pubsub-cdc-stream-failures\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-23T21:03:25.033Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-28T16:08:45.870Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"Bug\",\"Integration\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"ca21725b-1da0-47f6-a428-c5af7ea240a7\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-07-23T21:03:25.033Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\",\"createdById\":\"da28c5da-c96f-479f-b9d7-aa60800cd6af\",\"assignee\":\"Gabriel Rodrigues\",\"assigneeId\":\"da28c5da-c96f-479f-b9d7-aa60800cd6af\",\"project\":\"Genesis\",\"projectId\":\"4e08de05-a9c6-4111-91f8-809f8683ec38\",\"team\":\"The Agent Company\",\"teamId\":\"4bb32a8d-f4b6-4d35-8efc-a544d30e081d\",\"relations\":{\"blocks\":[],\"blockedBy\":[],\"relatedTo\":[{\"id\":\"TAC-577\",\"title\":\"Integration: Quickbooks\"},{\"id\":\"TAC-611\",\"title\":\"Salesforce sync: Pub/Sub / CDC bridge for near-real-time inbound\"}],\"duplicateOf\":null}}"
        }
      ]
    }
