            "type": "text",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"TAC-896\",\"title\":\"Test and validate Shopmonkey\",\"description\":\"Follow-up to [TAC-808](<https://linear.app/agentuity/issue/TAC-808/integration-shopmonkey>) after shipping the integration in <pull-request id=\\\"61d668e4-3faf-45d0-b704-97f723d688db\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/agentuity/review/featintegrations-shopmonkey-api-key-connect-and-collections-sync-tac-5b23c3bf050d\\\">agentuity/genesis-mono#825</pull-request>.\\n\\n## Status\\n\\nImplementation is merged. Live connect + Collections sync **still need testing and validation**, but we are **blocked waiting for a Shopmonkey developer / Admin account** (no self-serve sandbox; Admin API key required).\\n\\n## Need\\n\\n* Usable Shopmonkey shop (Admin)\\n* API key from Settings → Integration → API Keys\\n\\n## When unblocked\\n\\n1. Connect Shopmonkey on edge/preview (or local) via the API-key Connections flow\\n2. Enable Collections sync entities and verify inbound (webhook/poll)\\n3. Spot-check outbound limits (e.g. payments read-oriented; users no delete)\\n4. Confirm missions/capabilities work with the connected shop\\n\\n## Refs\\n\\n* PR: <pull-request id=\\\"61d668e4-3faf-45d0-b704-97f723d688db\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/agentuity/review/featintegrations-shopmonkey-api-key-connect-and-collections-sync-tac-5b23c3bf050d\\\">agentuity/genesis-mono#825</pull-request>\\n* Docs: [https://shopmonkey.dev/overview](<https://shopmonkey.dev/overview>)\",\"priority\":{\"value\":3,\"name\":\"Medium\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/agentuity/issue/TAC-896/test-and-validate-shopmonkey\",\"gitBranchName\":\"tac-896-test-and-validate-shopmonkey\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-03T15:41:21.680Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-03T15:41:21.680Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-03T15:41:21.750Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Paused\",\"statusType\":\"